WEBVTT

00:01:58.087 --> 00:02:01.034
SC: The one-minute answer:
you could ask yourself

00:02:01.058 --> 00:02:04.639
how do you feel when
you show up at a party

00:02:04.663 --> 00:02:08.489
that you're truly enjoying,
with company you truly like?

00:02:08.513 --> 00:02:11.581
If you're an extrovert, it's as if
you have an internal battery

00:02:11.605 --> 00:02:14.788
that is getting charged
by that experience.

00:02:14.812 --> 00:02:17.912
So at the end of the two hours,
now your battery's charged,

00:02:17.936 --> 00:02:20.752
you're raring to go,
you're looking for more.

00:02:20.776 --> 00:02:24.763
And if you're an introvert,
no matter how socially skilled you are

00:02:24.787 --> 00:02:27.016
and no matter how much fun
you've been having,

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.349
after two or three hours,
you just start to hit that mark